.TH PROVE 1
.SH NAME
prove \- prove a work left by the dead
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prove
.I ID
.br
.B prove
.I ID
.B account
.I FILE
.br
.B prove
.I ID
.B response
.I FILE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B prove
.I ID
begins. Prints the path of the work. The author of
.I ID
is dead.
.PP
.B account
records
.IR FILE ,
then prints the seal.
.PP
.B response
records
.IR FILE .
.PP
Each stage is done once.
.SH FILES
/library/catalog, /ossuary/
.SH SEE ALSO
admit(1)
